{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のちはるーむでは、明日からのアンダーライブのために、それぞれのサイリウムカラーを確認し合いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は地図の日。(最初の一歩の日)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は伊能忠敬が蝦夷地の測量のために"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出発した日です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので地図の日、最初の一歩の日と呼ばれているのです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊能忠敬懐かしい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔習った事も今日まで繋がっていると思うとロマンを感じますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は髪の毛を外ハネにしてみました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/04/19/1043193/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"①外ハネ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロングだとなかなか出来ない髪型だから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新鮮でなんか嬉しい☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして明日からのライブの髪型を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても迷っています...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日みたいな①外ハネにするか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"②ボリューム有りのぐりんぐりんに巻くか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"③ボリュームは少なめで巻くか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.sait